def clean_by_regions(lab, R, E, r, sc, near_edges):
    """1 November 2026 : the reference has the last word : inside a closed region of the image, a minority piece of a part whose inner outline follows no line is template noise, it goes to the part that dominates the region. A piece with a real outline stays, and so does a division the template knows when no part dominates."""
